[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Tencent Meeting (Wayland Guard)
Name[zh_CN]=腾讯会议（Wayland 修复版）
Comment=Launch Tencent Meeting with sandboxed Hunk 0 and PipeWire buffer guard
Comment[zh_CN]=使用沙箱 Hunk 0 与 PipeWire 缓冲守卫启动腾讯会议
